        "line": 17,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": "2. **Define the scope**"
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "   - What stage is this work?"
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "   - What feedback do you need?"
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": "   - What's out of scope?"
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "3. **Share materials in advance**"
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "   - Design files or prototypes"
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "   - User research findings"
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": "   - Business requirements"
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "### Facilitator Preparation"
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "- Set time limits"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "- Define feedback format"
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": "- Prepare prompts"
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": "## Critique Structure"
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "### 1. Presentation (5-10 min)"
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "Presenter shares:"
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "- Problem statement"
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": "- User needs"
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": "- Design solution"
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": "- Specific questions"
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": "### 2. Clarifying Questions (5 min)"
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "Reviewers ask questions to understand:"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": "- \"What happens when...?\""
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "- \"How did you decide...?\""
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": "- \"What alternatives did you consider?\""
      },
      {
        "line": 47,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 48,
        "text": "### 3. Feedback Round (15-20 min)"
      },
      {
        "line": 49,
        "text": "Each reviewer shares observations using the format below."
      },
      {
        "line": 50,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 51,
        "text": "### 4. Discussion (10 min)"
      },
      {
        "line": 52,
        "text": "- Explore key themes"
      },
      {
        "line": 53,
        "text": "- Identify next steps"
      },
      {
        "line": 54,
        "text": "- Prioritize changes"
      },
      {
        "line": 55,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 56,
        "text": "## Feedback Format"
      },
      {
        "line": 57,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 58,
        "text": "### The \"I Like, I Wish, What If\" Method"
      },
      {
        "line": 59,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 60,
        "text": "**I Like...**"
      },
      {
        "line": 61,
        "text": "What's working well"
      },
      {
        "line": 62,
        "text": "\"I like how the onboarding flow reduces friction.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 63,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 64,
        "text": "**I Wish...**"
      },
      {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "Opportunities for improvement"
      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": "\"I wish the error states were more helpful.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 67,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 68,
        "text": "**What If...**"
      },
      {
        "line": 69,
        "text": "Ideas to explore"
      },
      {
        "line": 70,
        "text": "\"What if we added a progress indicator?\""
      },
      {
        "line": 71,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 72,
        "text": "### The Observation Method"
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 74,
        "text": "**Observation \u2192 Impact \u2192 Suggestion**"
      },
      {
        "line": 75,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 76,
        "text": "\"I notice the CTA is below the fold. This might reduce conversions. Consider testing it above the fold.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 77,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 78,
        "text": "## Types of Feedback"
      },
      {
        "line": 79,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 80,
        "text": "### Actionable vs. Preferential"
      },
      {
        "line": 81,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": "**Actionable (Give this)**"
      },
      {
        "line": 83,
        "text": "\"The contrast ratio on this button is 2.8:1, which fails WCAG AA. Increase the contrast to at least 4.5:1.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 84,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 85,
        "text": "**Preferential (Avoid this)**"
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": "\"I don't like the blue. Try green instead.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 87,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 88,
        "text": "### Specific vs. Vague"
      },
      {
        "line": 89,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 90,
        "text": "**Specific (Give this)**"
      },
      {
        "line": 91,
        "text": "\"The form has 12 fields. Consider progressive disclosure to reduce cognitive load.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 92,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 93,
        "text": "**Vague (Avoid this)**"
      },
      {
        "line": 94,
        "text": "\"This feels overwhelming.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 95,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 96,
        "text": "## Feedback by Design Stage"
      },
      {
        "line": 97,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 98,
        "text": "### Early Exploration"
      },
      {
        "line": 99,
        "text": "Focus on:"
      },
      {
        "line": 100,
        "text": "- Problem framing"
      },
      {
        "line": 101,
        "text": "- Conceptual direction"
      },
      {
        "line": 102,
        "text": "- User needs alignment"
      },
      {
        "line": 103,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 104,
        "text": "Avoid:"
      },
      {
        "line": 105,
        "text": "- Visual polish details"
      },
      {
        "line": 106,
        "text": "- Pixel-level feedback"
      },
      {
        "line": 107,
        "text": "- Implementation concerns"
      },
      {
        "line": 108,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 109,
        "text": "### Mid-Fidelity"
      },
      {
        "line": 110,
        "text": "Focus on:"
      },
      {
        "line": 111,
        "text": "- Information architecture"
      },
      {
        "line": 112,
        "text": "- User flows"
      },
      {
        "line": 113,
        "text": "- Interaction patterns"
      },
      {
        "line": 114,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 115,
        "text": "Avoid:"
      },
      {
        "line": 116,
        "text": "- Final copy critique"
      },
      {
        "line": 117,
        "text": "- Color/font perfection"
      },
      {
        "line": 118,
        "text": "- Edge cases"
      },
      {
        "line": 119,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 120,
        "text": "### High-Fidelity"
      },
      {
        "line": 121,
        "text": "Focus on:"
      },
      {
        "line": 122,
        "text": "- Visual consistency"
      },
      {
        "line": 123,
        "text": "- Accessibility compliance"
      },
      {
        "line": 124,
        "text": "- Content quality"
      },
      {
        "line": 125,
        "text": "- Edge cases"
      },
      {
        "line": 126,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 127,
        "text": "## Receiving Feedback"
      },
      {
        "line": 128,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 129,
        "text": "### Do"
      },
      {
        "line": 130,
        "text": "- Listen fully before responding"
      },
      {
        "line": 131,
        "text": "- Take notes"
      },
      {
        "line": 132,
        "text": "- Ask clarifying questions"
      },
      {
        "line": 133,
        "text": "- Thank reviewers"
      },
      {
        "line": 134,
        "text": "- Follow up on actions"
      },
      {
        "line": 135,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 136,
        "text": "### Don't"
      },
      {
        "line": 137,
        "text": "- Defend every decision"
      },
      {
        "line": 138,
        "text": "- Explain away feedback"
      },
      {
        "line": 139,
        "text": "- Take it personally"
      },
      {
        "line": 140,
        "text": "- Ignore patterns in feedback"
      },
      {
        "line": 141,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 142,
        "text": "## Facilitation Tips"
      },
      {
        "line": 143,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 144,
        "text": "### Time Management"
      },
      {
        "line": 145,
        "text": "- Set clear time boxes"
      },
      {
        "line": 146,
        "text": "- Use a timer"
      },
      {
        "line": 147,
        "text": "- Interrupt politely if needed"
      },
      {
        "line": 148,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 149,
        "text": "### Encourage Participation"
      },
      {
        "line": 150,
        "text": "- Go around the room"
      },
      {
        "line": 151,
        "text": "- Call on quiet people"
      },
      {
        "line": 152,
        "text": "- Limit dominant voices"
      },
      {
        "line": 153,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 154,
        "text": "### Stay On Track"
      },
      {
        "line": 155,
        "text": "- Redirect tangents"
      },
      {
        "line": 156,
        "text": "- Park off-topic items"
      },
      {
        "line": 157,
        "text": "- Summarize key points"
      },
      {
        "line": 158,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 159,
        "text": "### Document Outcomes"
      },
      {
        "line": 160,
        "text": "- Capture all feedback"
      },
      {
        "line": 161,
        "text": "- Note priorities"
      },
      {
        "line": 162,
        "text": "- Assign owners to action items"
      },
      {
        "line": 163,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 164,
        "text": "## Remote Critique Best Practices"
      },
      {
        "line": 165,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 166,
        "text": "- Use collaborative tools (Figma, Miro)"
      },
      {
        "line": 167,
        "text": "- Enable commenting"
      },
      {
        "line": 168,
        "text": "- Mute when not speaking"
      },
      {
        "line": 169,
        "text": "- Use video for engagement"
      },
      {
        "line": 170,
        "text": "- Record for absent team members"
      }
    ],
